<article class="env-lemma" id="02FZ">
       
      
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02FZ">Lemma <span data-tag="02FZ">29.29.4</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $n \geq 0$. Assume $f$ is locally of finite type. The set </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  U_ n = \{ x \in X \mid \dim _ x X_{f(x)} \leq n\}   \]
</div>
  <p> is open in $X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is immediate from Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/00QH" data-tag="00QH">10.125.6</a> 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>